-- TEKNOFEST Bilgi Yarismasi - expand question bank
-- 2026-10-05. Apply manually after 20261005000008_room_lifecycle_and_robustness.sql.
-- Imports the larger client-side question set (src/data/questionBank.ts, now unused by the
-- client and removed from the bundle in this same change set) into the server-side pool so a
-- room has ~130 questions to draw from instead of 32, and rematches are far less likely to repeat.
